# Inventory only. Keep the live values in managed secret storage; never put values here.

| Secret/configuration | Owner | Used by | Backup treatment |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| IDENTITY_ACADEMICO_SERVICE_TOKEN | Identity + Académico operators | Identity API, Académico API | Record name/owner/rotation date only |
| IDENTITY_ACADEMICO_SERVICE_TOKEN_PREVIOUS | Identity operators | Identity API during overlap | Record expiry only; never export the value |
| EDUPAY_INTEGRATION_TOKEN | EduPay + Académico integration operators | Académico sync worker, EduPay integration API | Record name/owner/rotation date only; never store in Académico PostgreSQL |
| ACADEMIC_RESEND_API_KEY | Académico operations | Academic notification worker | Record provider/key reference only |
| RESEND_API_KEY | Identity operations | Identity email worker | Record provider/key reference only |
| IDENTITY_OUTBOX_ENCRYPTION_KEY | Identity operations | Identity email outbox/API/worker | Record secret-manager reference only |
| JWT private signing key | Identity operations | Identity API | Do not place in backup artifacts; verify managed key custody |
| Academic and Identity PostgreSQL credentials | Database operators | API and worker processes | Record secret-manager references only |
